WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:04.530
Dvin, on the plain of Ayrarat,

2
00:00:04.570 --> 00:00:09.204
was the seat of the catholicos,
head of the Armenian Church.

3
00:00:09.444 --> 00:00:14.173
In 640 the first Arab armies
came north into Armenia.

4
00:00:14.213 --> 00:00:17.849
Theodoros Rshtuni
took the field against them.

5
00:00:17.889 --> 00:00:20.619
But the raiders
reached the capital and took it,

6
00:00:20.659 --> 00:00:22.804
despite a stubborn defense.

7
00:00:23.044 --> 00:00:25.400
It was a raid, not yet a conquest;

8
00:00:25.440 --> 00:00:27.240
Dvin rose again.

9
00:00:27.369 --> 00:00:29.583
Man the walls.

